  "job_B18.10.2_20251003_114437": {
    "chunk_text": "Her ongyn\u00f0 secgean be \u00feam Godes sanctum \u00fee on Engla lande \u00e6rest reston. Sanctus Albanus martyr in Breotone se reste\u00f0 neah W\u00e6linga ceastre he \u00fe\u00e6re ea \u00fee is genemned \u00deonne reste\u00f0 Columcylle on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fee is genemned Duncabeam neah \u00fe\u00e6re ea \u00fee is genemned Tau. \u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sanctus Cu\u00f0berhtus on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe seo is genemned Ubban ford neh \u00fe\u00e6re ea \u00fee is \u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancta Oswald cyningc on Bebban byrig wi\u00f0 \u00fea s\u00e6, & his heafod reste\u00f0 mid sancte \u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sanctus Johannes on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe Beferlic neh \u00fe\u00e6re ea Hull. \u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancte Ecgbyrht, & sancte Wilfer\u00f0 bisceop, & sancte Wihtburht, on \u00feam mynstre \u00fee is \u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancte Ceadda, & sancte Cedde, & sancte Ceatta on \u00feam mynstre \u00fee is genemned Licetfeld, \u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancte Higebold on Lindisse, on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fee is genemned Cecesegi, neh \u00fe\u00e6re ea \u00fee is \u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancte \u00c6\u00f0ered se cyningc on \u00feam mynstre \u00fee is genemned Bardanig neh \u00fe\u00e6re ea \u00fee is \u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancte Eadburh on \u00feam mynstre \u00e6t Su\u00f0wyllum neh \u00fe\u00e6re ea \u00fee is genemned Treonte. \u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancte Gu\u00f0lac on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fee is genemned Cruland, \u00fe\u00e6t mynster is on middan Gyrwan \u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancte Ealhmund on \u00feam mynstre Nor\u00f0weor\u00f0ig neah \u00fe\u00e6re ea Deorwentan. \u00deonne w\u00e6s sancte Botolf gebyrged on \u00feam mynstre \u00fee is genem",
